// C1 of the -O0 mallocng functions (docs/overview.md, C1): each function's
// machine code implements its readable GIMPLE. `c1 FN SPEC PREFIX`: the
// checker's C1 engine walks FN's decode facts (`FN.at_*`, from `slc steps`)
// alongside SPEC's procedure, applying the rules of proofs/translate*.core
// through the kernel, and records the theorems PREFIX.body,
// PREFIX.implements, PREFIX.implements_abi, the effect lemmas
// (PREFIX.eff_*, PREFIX.io, PREFIX.typed) and the literal facts they use.
// A callee's contract is a premise of its caller's theorems
// (proofs/mallocng_link.core links them).
//
// Check after the specs, the decode facts and the program text, and the
// rules (proofs/x86*.core, proofs/abi*.core, proofs/gimple*.core,
// proofs/translate*.core).

c1 a_ctz_32 c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.a_ctz_32_fun act
c1 is_bouncing c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.is_bouncing_fun ibt
c1 get_slot_index c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.get_slot_index_fun gsit
c1 get_stride c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.get_stride_fun gst
c1 step_seq c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.step_seq_fun sst
c1 upgradelock c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.upgradelock_fun ugt
c1 resetlock c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.resetlock_fun rlt
c1 decay_bounces c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.decay_bounces_fun dbt
c1 a_clz_32 c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.a_clz_32_fun aclz
c1 dequeue c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.dequeue_fun dqt
c1 dequeue_head c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.dequeue_head_fun dqht
c1 queue c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.queue_fun qut
c1 free_meta c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.free_meta_fun fmt
c1 size_to_class c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.size_to_class_fun stct
c1 set_size c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.set_size_fun ssz
c1 enframe c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.enframe_fun eft
c1 account_bounce c_src_malloc_mallocng_malloc.account_bounce_fun acbt
